**Results:**
```
Asset Type    | Start      | End        | Growth
--------------|------------|------------|--------
Residential   | 270,495    | 296,227    | +9.5%
Industrial    | 564,189    | 637,884    | +13.0%
Commercial    | 220,544    | 205,210    | -7.0%
```

**Method:**
- Used compound daily growth rate: `(1 + total_growth)^(1/100) - 1`
- Added small Gaussian noise for realism (0.3-0.5% volatility)
- Seed: 123 (reproducible)
- Verified all 15 assets match target growth rates

